{"seq":18,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-haiku-none-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:45:25.452Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"28cd347507c06525c272db2087e93983f8926126c080e940bf4be2179cb15a63","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"@ruth.calloway, from Moss's digests and cheat sheet:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. Nadia's industrial account was reassigned to him on 2026-05-04 (Moss's 5/3 and 5/4 digests).\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. He took it over on 2026-05-04 (5/4 digest).\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, per the 9/30/2026 digest (\"Gideon's medical account\"). The digests don't say when it moved; a 2025 digest called it Nadia's medical account.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: the digests don't name an owner. Nadia is mentioned in connection with it, but not as owner.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 digest gave that as the handoff date.\n\nThe digests conflict in places and none are CRM records, so please confirm Orlavine and Quillfeather with Gideon or Nadia before the slide goes out.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
